[
  {
    "id": "socks5-connect-basic",
    "proto": "socks5",
    "summary": "SOCKS5 (端口 1080) 冒烟：完整 TCP 握手 + 方法协商 → CONNECT 请求/响应 + 终止",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "tcp": {
            "src_port": 12345,
            "dst_port": 1080
          }
        },
        {
          "socks5": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "min_packets": 9,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x002"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "1080"
        },
        {
          "packet": 2,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x012"
        },
        {
          "packet": 3,
          "field": "tcp.flags",
          "value": "0x010"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "socks.version",
          "value": "5"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "socks.auth_method",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "field": "socks.version",
          "value": "5"
        },
        {
          "packet": 6,
          "field": "socks.version",
          "value": "5"
        },
        {
          "packet": 6,
          "field": "socks.command",
          "value": "1"
        },
        {
          "packet": 6,
          "field": "socks.port",
          "value": "80"
        },
        {
          "packet": 7,
          "field": "socks.version",
          "value": "5"
        },
        {
          "packet": 7,
          "field": "socks.dst",
          "value": "0.0.0.0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 7,
          "field": "socks.port",
          "value": "0"
        }
      ],
      "frames": [
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "05 01 00"
        },
        {
          "packet": 5,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "05 00"
        },
        {
          "packet": 6,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "05 01 00 03 0f 77 77 77 2e 65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65 2e 63 6f 6d 00 50"
        },
        {
          "packet": 7,
          "offset": 54,
          "hex": "05 00 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "f4 客户端方法协商: VER 5 + 方法数 1 + 0x00=NO AUTH；f5 服务器接受 0x00；f6 CONNECT www.example.com:80 (ATYP 3=域名)；f7 响应成功 0x00 + BND.ADDR 0.0.0.0:0 (RFC 1928 §6 BND 可为空)",
        "域名 www.example.com 长 15 字节 (0x0f)；端口 80 = 0x0050；socks.port 是 tshark 的 SOCKS 端口字段（无 socks.dstport）",
        "10 帧 = 3 握手 + 4 数据 + 3 终止（双 FIN 后 ACK，f8=0x0011 f9=0x0011 f10=0x0010）；数据帧均 ≤76B 故不用 has_payload（frames 断言已覆盖）",
        "spec key 为 'socks'（非 'socks5'，registry 子映射键）"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "socks5_over_tls",
    "proto": "socks5",
    "summary": "SOCKS5-over-TLS：TLS 载体上的 SOCKS5 信令（[tcp,tls,socks5] 层链，1080 端口），tls 握手后 greeting/method/request/reply 信令字节",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "tcp": {
            "src_port": 13000,
            "dst_port": 1080
          }
        },
        {
          "tls": {}
        },
        {
          "socks5": {
            "auth_method": "password",
            "username": "alice",
            "password": "secret",
            "dst_addr": "target.example.com",
            "dst_port": 8080
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "has_handshake": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "1080"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "tls.record.content_type",
          "value": "22"
        },
        {
          "packet": 4,
          "field": "tls.record.length",
          "nonzero": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "notes": [
      "J 组组合层：socks5 层 OptionalOn: tls（registry.go）——显式写 tls 层启用 over-TLS，默认不启用",
      "信令字节经 TLS record 封装（application_data），socks.version 断言不适用于加密记录——用 tls.record.content_type 校验",
      "帧 4 是 tls 握手（content_type=22）；pop3_over_tls/mqtt_over_tls 同款模式",
      "decode_as: 1080 端口默认被 tshark SOCKS dissector 抢解析，须强制 TLS 解码才能断言 tls.record 字段"
    ],
    "decode_as": [
      "tcp.port==1080,tls"
    ]
  }
]